      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/839c29/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-07-08T22:52:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Welcome to the forums. I was thinking about this a couple days ago. Would be fun to do a sentinels story line battle day. Start with freedom fives battle against baron blade and just go through all the major battles up to this point. Biggest issue is knowing which hero teams fought who where. Would be nice to have this.</p>",
